  "pnpm": {
    "comment": "Security overrides for transitive dependencies (Dependabot/pnpm audit). Each forces a patched version within the same major to avoid breaking changes. Re-audit after bumping astro/jspdf and prune any that become redundant. vite is pinned (2026-11-16) because @astrojs/react still pulled vulnerable vite 8.2.2; keep it within astro's vite range (astro 7.4.7 needs ^8.3.5). astro and @astrojs/markdown-remark are pinned exactly (2026-11-16) to releases at least ~10 days old; relax to ^ on the next routine bump.",
